ado nos detalhes — da arquitetura de interiores à área de uso comum.\n\nUm apartamento pronto. Um projeto assinado. Um imóvel que já tem identidade.\n\n*As informações deste anúncio, incluindo valor e disponibilidade, poderão ser alteradas sem aviso prévio.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/561c3af4-32ba-4a8d-af41-d091087be86a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e7b2540c-9944-453b-b237-4153b5051bb2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cf7f6b91-2780-4e02-8183-ffd7a7f64e80.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/025ce5a6-1839-4a3b-9fd9-135fd80914db.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/28c8a624-6a9c-43a2-89d6-05ee7f572468.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1439db66-9ad0-4903-b66c-30e008b29f94.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/467e0b06-fcbf-4b54-a46e-c4091f6a8696.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/20e33034-2c38-48e4-b420-87fab05739bd.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4c3ae957-b872-4db7-9424-997e4952d52b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/720108c6-4f61-40d7-a862-4b18580e0e55.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f4b3f850-6fe4-47fd-a351-3abcabb2e916.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8626a5b1c404f7fa989be8/pilar-homes-imag